flowchart LR
    A[EDA + Cleaning<br/>After_EDA.csv] --> B[Feature Engineering<br/>120 features]
    B --> C[Train XGBoost<br/>5-fold CV]
    C --> D{Acceptance<br/>R² ≥ 0.80<br/>MAPE ≤ 15%}
