    G --> H[Serve via FastAPI<br/>load on cold start]
    H --> I[Log Predictions<br/>rec_log table]
    I --> J[Drift Monitor<br/>Evidently weekly]
    J --> K{Drift<br/>PSI > 0.2?}
    K -->|no| H
    K -->|yes| L[Alert + Retrain<br/>trigger pipeline]
    L --> B
    I --> M[Feedback Loop<br/>click / wishlist / buy]
    M --> N[LTR Training Set<br/>join rec_log + feedback]
    N --> C

